  "hints": [
    "A static route says: \"for this network, hand the packet to this next-hop address\". The next hop must be on a subnet the router is directly connected to.",
    "On R1: network 192.168.2.0/24 via 10.0.0.2.",
    "On R2: network 192.168.1.0/24 via 10.0.0.1, or 0.0.0.0/0 via 10.0.0.1."
