  "realityNote": "On Cisco IOS the command is `ip route 192.168.2.0 255.255.255.0 10.0.0.2`, and `show ip route` lists connected routes with C and static ones with S. A packet with no matching route is dropped and the router sends back an ICMP \"destination unreachable\"."
